{"id":"wb-5-375","name":"肇庆古城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"肇庆古城墙","text":"肇庆古城墙（又称肇庆宋城墙）位于中华人民共和国广东省肇庆市端州区，城墙现大部分保存完整，大致呈长方形，东西宽，南北窄，周长2801米，其中东段403.4米，西段376.9米，南段992.3米，北段1028.6米，共有28个敌台，有东西南北四城门，西北城墙上建有披云楼。1984年11月19日公布为第一批肇庆市文物保护单位。2001年列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%82%87%E5%BA%86%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99","revisionId":95006834,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95006834","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5a522f2c16315e580385ff8e.jpg","title":"20250914_Chaotian_Men.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250914_Chaotian_Men.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/20250914_Chaotian_Men.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Chaotian Gate","width":320,"height":240}}